# Generated per worktree by scripts/fleet/env.sh.
.env
.env.tmp*

# `.autofleet/run/` and `/findings.md` WERE HERE. The first held the
# `reviewed-<sha>` push markers guard.py read; the second was what the two local
# review passes wrote on the way to the PR body. armaatus/autofleet#152 removed
# both, and `env.sh` no longer creates the directory -- so what install.sh adds
# to a host's `.gitignore` and what this repo's own names are back in step,
# which is hard rule 1. A line for a file nothing writes is a line the next
# reader has to wonder about.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
